   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support menstrual education for girls in Bulgaria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Endometriosis and Reproductive Health Foundation Bulgaria supports women in their reproductive journey especially if they have chronic illnesses and infertility issues. In our 4+ years of operation we came to realize women in Bulgaria need better understanding of their menstrual health and how to support it and this has to start in early adolescent years.</narrative>
